438 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 93 0 R
/T (-Imbalance: only 21% of wines are Good; extreme scores \(3 and 9\) have very few examples. -Overfitting: the Decision Tree and Random Forest fit the training data almost perfectly. -Narrow data: white Vinho Verde wines from one region; results may not transfer to other wines. -Evaluation: a single train/test split, no cross-validation and no hyper-parameter tuning. -Statistics: unequal variance and heavy-tailed residuals in OLS; association is not causation. -Data cleaning: removing 937 duplicates reduced the sample from 4,898 to 3,961 wines.)
/E (-Imbalance: only 21% of wines are Good; extreme scores \(3 and 9\) have very few examples. -Overfitting: the Decision Tree and Random Forest fit the training data almost perfectly. -Narrow data: white Vinho Verde wines from one region; results may not transfer to other wines. -Evaluation: a single train/test split, no cross-validation and no hyper-parameter tuning. -Statistics: unequal variance and heavy-tailed residuals in OLS; association is not causation. -Data cleaning: removing 937 duplicates reduced the sample from 4,898 to 3,961 wines.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [30]
>>
