/Title (Multicollinearity. The variance inflation factor \(VIF\) is above 10 for density \(11.23\) and above 5 for residual sugar \(5.53\); the others are below 4.3. The model was therefore refitted without density \(Model 2\): R2 falls only from 0.2872 to 0.2770, all VIFs drop below 1.25, the alcohol coefficient rises to 0.377 and citric acid becomes non-significant \(p = 0.33\). Model 2 is the better model for interpreting the individual effects.)
